renoop-sleep-stage-trees 1
# Sleep stage per 30 s epoch (wake, light, deep, rem) from wrist motion and heart rate, first of two models: its probabilities are inputs of the second, not a hypnogram. Experimental. Trained on Wearanize+ OA (Radboud University, CC BY 4.0) and sleep-accel (Walch et al., PhysioNet, ODC-By 1.0).
